{"id":132,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究型学習を進める城西の教育力","feature_description":"城西大附属城西中学・高等学校は、教育理念やスクールポリシー、探究学習、グローバル教育、学習支援プログラムをまとめて発信しています。学校生活とクラブ活動も導線が明快で、学びの特色と部活動体験の両方を追いやすい公式サイトです。 学習支援や探究活動の案内も合わせて見られるため、進路と学校生活を同時に確認しやすい構成です。 体験入学や説明会の導線も整い、入学後の学校生活を想像しやすい構成です。","clubs":[{"id":2042,"name":"陸上部(中学/高校)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://josaigakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2043,"name":"硬式野球部(高校)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://josaigakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2044,"name":"軟式野球部(中学/高校)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://josaigakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2045,"name":"ダンス部(中学/高校)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://josaigakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2046,"name":"柔道部(中学/高校)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://josaigakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2047,"name":"剣道部(中学/高校)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://josaigakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2048,"name":"サッカー部(中学/高校)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://josaigakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2049,"name":"合気道部(中学/高校)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://josaigakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2050,"name":"男子ソフトテニス部(中学/高校)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://josaigakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2051,"name":"女子ソフトテニス部(中学/高校)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://josaigakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2052,"name":"女子バレーボール部(中学/高校)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://josaigakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2053,"name":"男子バスケットボール部(中学/高校)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://josaigakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2054,"name":"女子バスケット